BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hazing Prevention Speaker: Dr. Lyman Montgomery
DTSTART:20261130T220000
DTEND:20261201T010000
DTSTAMP:20261125T205300Z
UID:dc8af7f9477beb894afa863eef71f4@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:This event is open to all students! Dr. Lyman Montgomery is a 
 best-selling author\, international speaker\, and leadership coach with mo
 re than three decades of experience helping leaders and organizations alig
 n faith\, purpose\, and performance. As a certified life and business coac
 h\, Six Sigma Black Belt\, and seasoned HR professional\, he has trained t
 housands worldwide\, inspiring people to live with clarity\, discipline\, 
 and impact. His work has been featured in multiple publications\, and his 
 books\, including Harmony in the Hustle and Shattered Masks\, have touched
  the lives of readers across the globe. Today\, his story is about redempt
 ion and focus. He earned a Ph.D.\, wrote seven books\, two of which became
  best sellers\, and appeared in the award-winning documentary Unmasking Ho
 pe. Dr. Montgomery trained more than 60\,000 professionals around the worl
 d and built three successful companies. Dr. Montgomery is a member of Phi 
 Beta Sigma Fraternity\, Inc. --- Event Details: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp
 ?id=406493\n\nSource: Worcester Polytechnic Institute\nEvent page: https:/
 /mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=406493
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
URL:https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=406493
END:VEVENT
