DESCRIPTION:Come learn and practice your Judo skills! All liability forms 
 must be completed prior to attending events. Instructions: Go to myWPI (we
 bsite or app) Log in with SSO Click the Groups tab and search for Club Spo
 rts Go to Surveys (the third tab) Complete the following forms: Release of
  Liability\, Assumption of Risk\, and Indemnification – Club Sports 2026
 -27 Anti-Hazing Form – General Member – Club Sports 2026-27 Concussion
  Training – Club Sports 2026-27 Concussion Training You will need to cre
 ate a TRAIN.org account if you do not already have one. Training Link: CDC
  HEADS UP Concussion Training After completing the training\, download you
 r certificate and upload it through the Club Sports survey. Important: Thi
 s training is required every year. Returning participants must retake the 
 training and upload a new certificate for the 2026-27 academic year. --- E
 vent Details: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=406558\n\nSource: Worcester Po
 lytechnic Institute\nEvent page: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=406558
