  following forms: Release of Liability\, Assumption of Risk\, and Indemnif
 ication – Club Sports 2026-27 Anti-Hazing Form – General Member – Cl
 ub Sports 2026-27 Concussion Training – Club Sports 2026-27 Concussion T
 raining You will need to create a TRAIN.org account if you do not already 
 have one. Training Link: CDC HEADS UP Concussion Training After completing
  the training\, download your certificate and upload it through the Club S
 ports survey. Important: This training is required every year. Returning p
 articipants must retake the training and upload a new certificate for the 
 2026-27 academic year. --- Event Details: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=40
