BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Winter Wellness Fest
DTSTART:20261205T150000
DTEND:20261205T180000
DTSTAMP:20261125T205300Z
UID:b5baa4dd91106b7baea069a2ff6da5@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Winter Wellness Fest: Get Ready for Finals The Jo 10 am-1 pm F
 inals are coming up\, and we’ve got the perfect way to help you get read
 y. Join us at The Jo for Winter Wellness Fest: a morning full of fun\, rel
 axation\, and good vibes to recharge your body and mind. Start off with a 
 casual 1-mile run or walk with the Running Club\, then take a moment to re
 lax or chill out in the sauna or cold plunge. Need to relax? We’ve got m
 assages and therapy dogs ready to help you unwind. Don’t miss out on som
 e healthy snacks to keep you fueled. Want to stretch it out? Join the yoga
  session to breathe easy and calm your mind. Or get your energy going with
  Zumba before hitting the books. And there will be lots of games\, cornhol
 e and other fun activites too. Taking care of yourself means you’ll stud
 y smarter and feel better. So\, come hang out\, relax\, and kick off final
 s feeling refreshed and ready to crush it! This event is for Holy Cross st
 udents only. Everyone’s welcome just as you are. Note: Massages & Sauna/
  Cold Plunge is frist come\, first served. If you plan on using the sauna 
 or plunge pool\, please bring dry clothes to change into - towels will be 
 provided. Sponsored by Student Wellness Education (SWELL) & Campus Recreat
 ion --- Event Details: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2155405\n\nSourc
 e: College of the Holy Cross\nEvent page: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?
 id=2155405
LOCATION:The Jo\, 1 College Street\, Worcester\, MA 01610\, United States
URL:https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2155405
END:VEVENT
