UID:825efee860f9a96a36fd5811657b4d@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Looking to reconnect or jump start your co-curricular involvem
 ent? RSVP to attend “Reconnect with Campus” on Wednesday\, January 12 
 from 10:30am-3:00pm. This is an in-person event only. During this personal
 ized engagement experience\, students will: • Learn about campus involve
 ment opportunities and resources. • Receive information about clubs and 
 organizations currently welcoming new members and how to connect with upco
 ming meetings and events. • Explore their interests\, goals\, and involv
 ement preferences with peer leaders and staff. • Participate in a Connec
 tions Café conversation designed to build relationships and strengthen th
 eir sense of belonging. • Enjoy lunch with a student leader from an orga
 nization they are interested in learning more about. All students should p
 lan to attend “Jump Starting your Spring Involvement” and Lunch with a
  Leader. Afternoon sessions are highly encouraged but not required. Studen
 t attendees can alternatively attend Leadership Day afternoon sessions. Th
 is event is open to WPI Students ONLY. --- Event Details: https://mywpi.wp
 i.edu/rsvp?id=406739\n\nSource: Worcester Polytechnic Institute\nEvent pag
 e: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=406739
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
URL:https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=406739
END:VEVENT
