SUMMARY:100 Days Ball - Class of 2027
DTSTART:20270319T220000
DTEND:20270320T030000
DTSTAMP:20261125T205300Z
UID:f78dc58fadd1bb8fa0e62456de4b77@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:100 Days Ball for the Class of 2026 is Friday\, March 19\, 202
 7. This event is open to members of the Class of 2027. Each member of the 
 Class of 2027 is eligible to purchase one ticket to the event. Cost of a t
 icket includes food stations throughout the night\, entertainment\, transp
 ortation to and from Union Station\, and one (1) complimentary drink ticke
 t. Ticket sales will be on sale via myHC starting Monday\, February 15\, 2
 027 and ending on Friday\, March 5\, 2027. Tickets are non-transferable an
 d non-refundable. If you are having difficulty purchasing your ticket via 
 this link please contact Caitlin MacNeil\, Associate Director of Student I
 nvolvement\, via email at cemacnei@holycross.edu. Tickets are in the form 
 of a bracelet which will be picked up on either Thursday\, March 18\, 2027
  or Friday\, March 19\, 2027. There are limited need-based financial assis
 tance grants available for seniors to attend 100 Days Ball\, made possible
  by the Purple Key Society. This application will become available on Mond
 ay\, February 15\, 2027 via myHC. --- Event Details: https://myhc.holycros
 s.edu/rsvp?id=2155319\n\nSource: College of the Holy Cross\nEvent page: ht
 tps://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2155319
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
URL:https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2155319
END:VEVENT
